  "caveats": [
    "Question 33 income includes any game development source and may include salary, advertisements, client work or other game-related earnings, not exclusively itch.io game sales.",
    "The voluntary survey has no known probability of inclusion for the full web game community or the eligible paid game seller cohort.",
    "Question 28 selects itch.io or similar websites, not necessarily verified itch.io accounts, and no raw cross-tab with Q33 is available.",
    "Percentages are rounded, and bins have inconsistent boundary labels; report bracket membership not interpolated exact percentiles.",
    "63% respondents with zero overall gamedev income is not the platform's fraction of positive-price projects with zero completed game purchases.",
    "The HTML report and PDF report disagree on publication date; survey collection month and primary respondent counts are consistent.",
    "Survey excludes nonrespondents and does not disclose all game sales, labor expense, taxes or the self-selection mechanism."
